This project is an independent Apple Silicon runtime for the Laya decision
model. It is not an official Convai Innovations release.

Laya weights and the original training code are Copyright Convai Innovations
and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Download them from
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya — they are not included here.

The Neural Engine body is a ModernBERT port of the BC1S / 1x1-conv rewrite
approach used by mizorewww/laya-mlx. That repository is a separate MLX port.
This tree adds the ANE + GPU router (LayaFast) and the measurement log in
summary.md.
